WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.134 --> 00:00:09.781
Which is the tallest?

2
00:00:09.782 --> 00:00:12.838
The orange building is the tallest.

3
00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:16.413
Which is the smallest?

4
00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:19.655
The brown dog is the smallest.

5
00:00:19.656 --> 00:00:22.962
Which is the heaviest?

6
00:00:22.963 --> 00:00:26.633
The purple hippo is the heaviest.

7
00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:29.935
Which is the lightest?

8
00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:33.455
The yellow feather is the lightest.

9
00:00:33.457 --> 00:00:36.740
Which is the longest?

10
00:00:36.741 --> 00:00:40.292
The red train is the longest.

11
00:00:40.293 --> 00:00:43.803
Which is the shortest?

12
00:00:43.804 --> 00:00:47.354
The blue crayon is the shortest.

13
00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:50.738
Which is the fastest?

14
00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:54.146
The green frog is the fastest.

15
00:00:54.147 --> 00:00:57.138
Which is the slowest?

16
00:00:57.139 --> 00:01:01.039
The rainbow snail is the slowest.
